From: Duron27 <duron27@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Arrows, thrown weapons and spell bolts of other players, spell cast and hit effects (visuals only)

- player.lua works out the aim (crosshair ray, then a ray from the body) and tells the global script when a spell is
  cast or a bow/crossbow/thrown weapon is released
- relay forwards a new uncached message type "shot" to everyone
- shots.lua flies a harmless object from start to end and plays the spell hit effect there
- remote.lua shows the spell cast effect on the avatar (and hit effect for self spells)
- relay test covers shot routing

---
